# A lifecycle's states are the only values its property takes, so they complete
# as a Literal; the action after them has a typed signature. Run through media/sdk/record.
Source editor.tape

Sleep 700ms
Type "o" Enter
Type "for h in hilltop.harvests:" Enter
Type "if h.status == "
Sleep 400ms
Ctrl+X
Ctrl+O
Sleep 2.8s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 900ms
Ctrl+Y
Sleep 400ms
Type ":" Enter
Type "h."
Sleep 2.5s
Type "record_harvest("
Sleep 4s
